a bigger thing around how, although yes

00:55:24.873 --> 00:55:27.660
our government has a
much bigger role to play

00:55:27.660 --> 00:55:30.500
and in ending gun violence
and passing these laws

00:55:30.500 --> 00:55:31.900
and helping fund these programs.

00:55:31.900 --> 00:55:33.700
There's also a cultural
role that we need to have

00:55:33.700 --> 00:55:37.430
a reevaluation, why are we as a country,

00:55:37.430 --> 00:55:42.430
so obsessed with machines
made to kill people,

00:55:44.464 --> 00:55:46.273
that's what they are, right.

00:55:47.240 --> 00:55:50.803
Why do we romanticize
violence, and stigmatize,

00:55:50.803 --> 00:55:53.183
so many other things that are not

00:55:53.183 --> 00:55:57.727
like that, and it's, I

00:56:00.571 --> 00:56:02.761
I think it goes into not
just a cultural aspect

00:56:02.761 --> 00:56:05.680
because the way I see ending
gun violence is it's like

00:56:05.680 --> 00:56:08.026
I think about a third of
it is like the gun laws.

00:56:08.026 --> 00:56:09.330
I think a third of it is

00:56:09.330 --> 00:56:11.870
