cultural aspect that we have to

00:56:16.000 --> 00:56:17.693
we have to acknowledge the fact

00:56:17.693 --> 00:56:18.960
that although our government is corrupt

00:56:18.960 --> 00:56:21.450
in a number in, in many ways

00:56:21.450 --> 00:56:24.560
ultimately our government
is a product of not all

00:56:24.560 --> 00:56:27.530
of us because of rampant, voter
suppression, but many of us.

00:56:27.530 --> 00:56:29.918
