our values as a society

00:56:29.918 --> 00:56:33.390
as a society, we need to either reaffirm

00:56:33.390 --> 00:56:36.000
or change some of what
we truly reprioritize

00:56:36.000 --> 00:56:39.580
what we truly do value,
in order to do that.

00:56:39.580 --> 00:56:40.870
And I think that that comes

00:56:40.870 --> 00:56:43.380
down to a whole conversation
too, around justice and not

00:56:43.380 --> 00:56:47.156
I truly believe that if we
want to end gun violence

00:56:47.156 --> 00:56:49.211
gun violence, we need
to acknowledge that gun

00:56:49.211 --> 00:56:50.410
violence is a symptom of injustice.

00:56:50.410 --> 00:56:52.750
If we don't address that injustice

00:56:52.750 --> 00:56:55.480
if we can't make a, an unjust country

00:56:55.480 --> 00:56:59.620
we'll never be a piece of
country, a peaceful country ever.

00:56:59.620 --> 00:57:02.940
